{
  "chapter": "site",
  "quests": [
    {
      "key": "gg.site.intro",
      "title": "Ruins and Camps",
      "tier": "Steam",
      "desc": [
        "Factories, houses, bunkers, camps and ships dot the Overworld, and their chests hold GregGuns gear you would otherwise have to craft. Each structure draws from loot tables with a tier ceiling: the small ruins stop at LV, and everything bigger stops at MV, so a trip is worth it at any stage but never hands you the next tier early.",
        "Structures spawn only in the Overworld and an admin can turn any of them off in the worldgen section of the GregGuns config. Vanilla chests fill when the world generates; Weapon and Reinforced chests fill the first time someone opens them.",
        "Each quest in this chapter asks you to bring back something you can find there. Craftable items count too, so you can also build your way through, but the loot is free.",
        "[note]Go armed: carry a Hand Cannon and some stone bullets before you leave the base.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
        "gg.steam.hand_cannon",
        11
      ],
