    {
      "key": "gg.site.surface",
      "title": "Small Ruins",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "The small factory, train station, gas station and medium house are the easy stops. Their chests draw from the LV weapon table: 9mm and shotgun rounds, revolvers, sawed-offs and the occasional Hand Cannon. The medium house also holds Reinforced Chests of GregTech ingots (tin, copper, lead, iron) and a few Weapon Chests.",
        "Bring back a revolver, sawed-off or Hand Cannon, and some 9mm or shotgun rounds. Both are LV guns you can also build with a steel plate, so check NEI if the chests are not generous."
      ],
      "pre": [
