    {
      "key": "gg.site.dungeon",
      "title": "Dungeon Weapons",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Roguelike dungeons sink deep into the ground. Near the surface they hold LV gear, deeper down MV gear, depending on how your pack's dungeon loot is set up.",
        "Bring back one gun and one blade from your delve: a pistol, revolver or sawed-off, and a Combat Knife or Crowbar. If the dungeon is stingy, you can always build them.",
        "[warn]Dungeons are full of vanilla mobs and traps. Bring armor, light and an exit plan.[/warn]"
