    {
      "key": "gg.site.bunker",
      "title": "Big Bunker",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "The Big Bunker is a concrete fortress with Weapon and Reinforced chests throughout and a spawner room, and its loot reaches MV: Thompsons, MAC-10s, AK-47s, M4s and their magazines. Zombie Soldiers, Farmers and Miners spill out of the vanilla mob spawners inside, three at a time, up to five of each at once.",
        "Kill three Zombie Soldiers and take an MV gun out of the chests. Breaking a spawner by hand takes a long time, so farm it instead.",
        "[warn]The zombies carry guns and the bunker is dark. Bring light and armor.[/warn]"
      ],
      "pre": [
